			"Message": "build(Worker): Compile ESBuild configuration to minified output\n\nRun ESBuild to compile the Worker element's build configuration into minified JavaScript with source maps in the Configuration directory.\n\nThe source file `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` received minor whitespace adjustments. The compiled output `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` now uses compressed variable declarations and removes blank lines between properties. The companion `Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js` was similarly compiled from its source, now featuring helper functions `__defProp` and `__name` with inline formatting. Both compiled outputs include `//# sourceMappingURL` references for debugging.\n\nThis generates the deployed build artifacts alongside the maintainable source configuration.",
